Description:
A standard issue combat knife, with notching ridges along the base of the blade.
Low damage, but very fast swing speed.
Affected by Berserk.
While the strength multiplier is cut to a measly 2x, the swing speed is doubled.
Secondary fire does a stab. Also affected by Berserk, under the same principle as above.
Tap Altfire for a quick jab, hold altfire to "cook" a stronger thrust.